### Get Order By Id
POST {{appsScriptUrl}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "secret": "{{sharedSecret}}",
  "action": "getOrderById",
  "payload": {
    "orderId": "{{orderId}}"
  }
